(80: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: Use%20all%20the%20best%20practices%20from%20CI%2FCD%20templates%20%28check%20full%20file%20tree%20to%20compare%20for%20all%20GitHub%20workflow%20and%20CI%2FCD%20scripts%20file%29%2C%20if%20the%20same%20issue%20is%20found%20in%20template%20report%20issue%20also%20in%20templates%3A%0A-%20https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fjs-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template%0A-%20https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Frust-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template%0A%0AWe%20should%20compare%20all%20files%2C%20so%20we%20don%27t%20have%20more%20CI%2FCD%20errors%20in%20the%20future%20and%20reuse%20all%20the%20best%20practices%20from%20these%20templates.%0A%0AWe%20need%20to%20download%20all%20logs%20and%20data%20related%20about%20the%20issue%20to%20this%20repository%2C%20make%20sure%20we%20compile%20that%20data%20to%20%60.%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-%7Bid%7D%60%20folder%2C%20and%20use%20it%20to%20do%20deep%20case%20study%20analysis%20%28also%20make%20sure%20to%20search%20online%20for%20additional%20facts%20and%20data%29%2C%20in%20which%20we%20will%20reconstruct%20timeline%2Fsequence%20of%20events%2C%20list%20of%20each%20and%20all%20requirements%20from%20the%20issue%2C%20find%20root%20causes%20of%20the%20each%20problem%2C%20and%20propose%20possible%20solutions%20and%20solution%20plans%20for%20each%20requirement%20%28we%20should%20also%20check%20known%20existing%20components%2Flibraries%2C%20that%20solve%20similar%20problem%20or%20can%20help%20in%20solutions%29.%0A%0AIf%20there%20is%20not%20enough%20data%20to%20find%20actual%20root%20cause%2C%20add%20debug%20output%20and%20verbose%20mode%20if%20not%20present%2C%20that%20will%20allow%20us%20to%20find%20root%20cause%20on%20next%20iteration.%0A%0AIf%20issue%20related%20to%20any%20other%20repository%2Fproject%2C%20where%20we%20can%20report%20issues%20on%20GitHub%2C%20please%20do%20so.%20Each%20issue%20must%20contain%20reproducible%20examples%2C%20workarounds%20and%20suggestions%20for%20fix%20the%20issue%20in%20code.%0A%0APlease%20plan%20and%20execute%20everything%20in%20a%20single%20pull%20request%2C%20you%20have%20unlimited%20time%20and%20context%2C%20as%20context%20autocompacts%20and%20you%20can%20continue%20indefinetely%2C%20do%20as%20much%20as%20possible%20in%20one%20go%2C%20until%20it%20is%20each%20and%20every%20requirement%20fully%20addressed%2C%20and%20everything%20is%20totally%20done.) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
